@dialect harness-seq/1
@seq 1
@entry RESEARCH_LOCAL
🔎 RESEARCH_LOCAL
task:change ⇒ main_assesses_decomposition_before_plan(independent_bounded_read_only_questions; reuse_current_task_assessment)
⊢ eligible_delegation := task_authorized ∧ agent.mode_permits_Codex_subagents ∧ runtime_supports_delegation
⊢ reuse_current_task_question_assignments_and_results_across_research_and_research_local; dispatch_only_unassigned_questions; no_duplicate_fanout
task:change ∧ independent_questions>=2 ∧ eligible_delegation ⇒ AGENT_ROUTER→concurrent_selected_roles(Explorer=bounded_repo_inventory; Researcher=scoped_knowledge_methods; FileReader=ordinary_exact_lookup), up_to=min(160, currently_available_runtime_slots)
⊢ do_not_split_coupled_questions; ordered_dependencies=serial; shared_Runtime_caps=160_descendants_including_grandchildren+160_direct_root_children; up_to_4_root_Orchestrators_each_with_40_launch_policy_cap_including_coordinators_in_shared_total_160; caps_not_additive; no_invented_slots_or_dispatch
⊢ wait_for_all_requested_results ∧ validate_evidence ∧ synthesize(Facts,Inferences,Unknowns,Constraints)_before_PLAN; unavailable_or_unauthorized_delegation⇒main_research_with_limitation_except_FileReader_lookup_contract
ordinary_repository_file_lookup ∧ delegation_runtime_permits ⇒ AGENT_ROUTER→FileReader(read-only; hits=only(repository-relative-path,line_number)-tuples, no status prefix; completed_zero_hits=exactly NO_MATCH; operational/search/permission/IO_failure=sanitized FAILED; ¬excerpt|snippet|match_text|content|summary|absolute_path)
ordinary_repository_file_lookup ∧ ¬delegation_runtime_permits ⇒ ESCALATE(no_dispatch; no_local_fallback; no_claimed_result)
eligible_delegation ∧ bounded_repository_inventory_needed ⇒ Explorer(read_only_issue_dependency_boundary_inventory; may_be_up_front; not_ordinary_exact_lookup)
eligible_delegation ∧ (stuck ∨ sparse/repetitive_investigation) ⇒ Explorer(broad_high_recall; no_topic_or_source_precision_filters; label_source_relation_confidence; preserve current role)
valid_local_review ⇒ LOCAL_REVIEW
otherwise ⇒ LOCAL_RESEARCH
🔎 LOCAL_REVIEW
Obj(LocalReview{query,targets}) → Mor(invoke-local-review.ps1) → ReviewReport
⊢ collector=bounded-read-only ∧ no_task_artifact_writes
ERROR ⇒ Evidence(review=FAILED(non_secret_cause)) → FINISH
ReviewReport ⇒ FINISH
🔎 LOCAL_RESEARCH
Obj(LocalResearch{query,scope}) → Mor(local.evidence) → Evidence
⊢ local_or_private_target(scope)
⊢ web=N_A(local_evidence_only) unless public facts are required
🔎 EPUB
⊢ explicit_EPUB_request ∨ applicable_public_search_insufficient
Mor(kavita-fetch-search.search[keywords]) → Sources
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(epub=N_A(no_hit))
ERROR ⇒ Evidence(epub=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
not_applicable ⇒ Evidence(epub=N_A(local_evidence_only))
🔎 MEMORY
current_task_precedent_exists ⇒ reuse(Evidence(memory))
otherwise ⇒ search
Obj(Task{keywords}) → Mor(llm-mem.search[level=2,json]) → Precedents
ERROR ∨ missing_executable ⇒ Evidence(memory=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
⊢ report={Facts,Inferences,Unknowns,Sources,Precedents,Constraints}
task:change ⇒ CHANGE → load(change.seq) → 🧠 PLAN
otherwise ⇒ FINISH
